Explanation: To determine if we can publish "Summer at Dunmore Pier" on SVOD in the United States on 2026-10-01, we need to check if the license window for this title has opened. If the license window has not yet started, then the title cannot be published on that date. In this case, the "window_not_open" constraint indicates that the license window has not started yet, so we cannot publish the title on 2026-10-01. Additionally, since the rights are not exclusive, this information is also provided.

