Explanation: The theatrical release date has been moved up to December 3, 2026. If PVOD typically follows theatrical by 45 days, the earliest PVOD release date would be January 17, 2027 (December 3, 2026 + 45 days). Since the requested PVOD date is January 20, 2027, it is within the window, but the actual window for PVOD release has not yet opened based on the new theatrical release date. Therefore, the "window_not_open" constraint applies.
